    "updated_at": "2026-11-12T09:37:39Z",
    "body": "Refreshed with main (c8a1bab1): merged the refreshed #1113 (`issue/931-wcs-index-app`, a7179f8b) first, then `upstream/main`. Main was already in through #1113, so the second merge had nothing to do. Head is now 0f34ac74.\n\nTwo files conflicted:\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/setup_tools.rs`, in the `TOOLS` table. Both sides are kept: this PR's index-based `set_work_offset` entry, and main's new `set_raw_stock_only` entry. The rest of the file auto-merged, and it is 323 lines.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`: this PR had 22 and #1113/main have 18. It is set to 23.\n\n`git diff upstream/main --stat` lists only the #931 stack's files. Tests: app `mcp_work_offset` 4/4, `wcs_index` 4/4, `mcp` 18/18, `recorded_post_streams` 2/2, and post `recorded_streams` 10/10. The ui lib, run from `crates/ui`, passed 564 with 5 ignored and no law_tests failures. Clippy `-D warnings` is clean on ui `--all-targets` and on app `--lib --bins --test '*'`. It ran per target because of #1146: on main the app lib tests don't compile, from `rotary_law_tests.rs:27`, which is missing `neck`. Stays draft.\n",
