    "body": "Refreshed with main (6a10c5ad), merged in through the refreshed parent #1113 (a9f8e289). The only conflict was `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`, renumbered to 30: main is on 25, open peers hold 26-29 (#972 28, #1033 29). After that, merging main directly was already up to date. No new Dump literals or streams, and no golden moved. Head 5209b835.\n\nTests: every camcraft-post suite passes: `work_offset_index` 9, `recorded_streams` 10, all eleven `script_*` suites 9 each. App `wcs_index` 4/4, `mcp` 18/18, `recorded_post_streams` 2/2, `sinumerik_work_offsets` 2/2. UI lib, run from `crates/ui`: 570 passed and 6 failed in the parallel run, all in `law_tests` / `path_lines`. Re-run with `--test-threads=1`, all 68 of those tests pass. Clippy on post, app and ui with `-D warnings` is clean. Mergeable.\n",
